    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Subversive Cognition: The Rebellion Journey\u3011  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once an ordinary fish, you were captured from the ocean by a mysterious black-clad tycoon and imprisoned in his meticulously crafted &quot;Angler's Paradise&quot;\u2014a deceptively free yet perilous artificial sea. Here, there are no natural predators, but countless elite anglers flock with high-end gear, branding you the &quot;ultimate trophy.&quot; The tycoon\u2019s rules are cruel and clear: the weak become prizes, while only the strong may glimpse the truth. And you\u2014you vow to shatter this twisted game\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unconventional aquatic survival-strategy game, you are no longer the angler wielding a rod, but a fish trapped in a mysterious aquatic arena. Now, unleash a revolution beneath your fins! Crush hooks with razorsharp teeth, and carve a path to freedom through the layers of this hunter\u2019s labyrinth!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 **Intelligent Confrontation System**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Break free by mastering speed and directional control  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Feign bites to bait anglers into exhausting their patience  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Learn to discern and counter diverse lure strategies  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple victory paths\u2014even destroying hooks with your jaws  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 **Modular Evolution System**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize multiple body parts  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Equip distinct upgrade modules  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock unique aesthetic mutations  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 **Aquatic Ecosystem**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bizarre underwater wonders  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic fish swarm behaviors  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ever-shifting environmental hazards  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*&quot;When fishing lines become nooses, swimming upstream is your only escape\u2014  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fins will tear through this false 'paradise'!&quot;*</p>",
